{"ID":"20240515131444-lgh3msb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131444-lgh3msb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131444-lgh3msb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133127-1nq969u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133127-1nq969u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133127-1nq969u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:459,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:495\u0026#125;","title":"018","type":"doc","updated":"20240515151346"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133127-1nq969u","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 904px;","id":"20240515133127-1nq969u","updated":"20240515151346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/8/4"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cf"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"76歲，略瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/4"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n氣喘、 頭痛、 頭暈無恶心 、搖頭不止（有吃鎮靜藥）、手也抖，昏倒時嘔吐更重，見光則吐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甲狀腺亢進十幾年（沒吃藥）  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1吐氣困難（肺有問題） \n2不噁心 \n3睡眠還好 \n4見光就想吐（陽虛）\n5口渴還好→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"師問他口渴否，乃欲查其體內津液狀況，因欲採吐法之前需知其體內津液是否足夠。\n6痰很多  \n7大便一天一次（軟）\n8胃口尚可"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：寸關有脈且數，尺部無脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：病在上（痰飲之固痰），採吐法"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n藜蘆2錢 炙甘草3錢 大棗10枚 生薑2錢 麻黃2錢 射干3錢 紫菀3錢 款冬花2錢 杏仁2錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 帖  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成 3 碗    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1.藜蘆甘草湯用來吐痰  射干麻黃湯開肺氣"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.昏倒時嘔吐更重，見光則吐→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因光是陽，他陽虛，故見光則吐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.搖頭不止（有吃鎮靜藥）、手也抖→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"此乃有風有痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：\n藜蘆可以去經脈上的痰。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"採吐法前，要確定病人胃中有無津液（口不渴、才可吐）  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"此為金匱中的趺厥病"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}